[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4443.669, "timestamp": "01:14:03", "text": "确实如此。 确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4445.91, "timestamp": "01:14:05", "text": "它看起来就像和所有人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4457.91, "timestamp": "01:14:17", "text": "卡米拉。 卡米拉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4460.39, "timestamp": "01:14:20", "text": "我想我知道卡米拉想要什么。 我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4462.55, "timestamp": "01:14:22", "text": "如果你能借给我一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4467.99, "timestamp": "01:14:27", "text": "百万美元这笔小额贷款就好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4470.31, "timestamp": "01:14:30", "text": "确切地。 是的。 是的。 不，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4473.03, "timestamp": "01:14:33", "text": "一百万美元。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4475.27, "timestamp": "01:14:35", "text": "嗯，不。 她就说：“是啊，如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4483.99, "timestamp": "01:14:43", "text": "它值多少钱？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4485.189, "timestamp": "01:14:45", "text": "好的，我再确认一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4486.149, "timestamp": "01:14:46", "text": "实际上，我还要添加游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4488.39, "timestamp": "01:14:48", "text": "物品栏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4492.95, "timestamp": "01:14:52", "text": "我们应该……它值多少钱？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4495.83, "timestamp": "01:14:55", "text": "各位，它值多少钱？   我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4498.149, "timestamp": "01:14:58", "text": "天哪。 我其实挺喜欢……等等。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4499.189, "timestamp": "01:14:59", "text": "原以为明天就要进口那个东西了"}]